# BUGS

C++ has no exceptions (6f2a), and no `std::filesystem`, `std::random_device` or iostreams (6e2e).

`freopen`, `fgetpos`, `fsetpos`, `rewind`, `tmpfile` and `tmpnam` are missing: llvm-libc has none of them for any target.
`fopen`'s `"x"` (exclusive creation) is not taken.
